{"id":"xacmaz","qid":"Q1018160","category":"city","type":"oikonym","names":{"az":"Xaçmaz","ru":"Хачмаз","en":"Xaçmaz"},"coordinates":[48.80278,41.46806],"coordinatesSource":"wd","region":"quba-xacmaz","regionSource":"wp-az-regions","admin":[{"qid":"Q6398826","az":"Xaçmaz rayonu","en":"Khachmaz District"}],"firstRecord":{"year":1938,"precision":"year","bce":false,"kind":"inception","source":"wd"},"period":"contemporary","forms":[],"namedAfter":[],"etymology":[],"summary":{"az":{"text":"Xaçmaz — Azərbaycan Respublikasının Xaçmaz rayonunun Xaçmaz şəhər inzibati ərazi dairəsində şəhər, Xaçmaz rayonunun inzibati mərkəzi. 1938-ci ildə rayon tabeli şəhər statusu almışdır.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-az"},"ru":{"text":"Хачма́з (азерб. Xaçmaz, лезг. Хъачмаз) — город на севере Азербайджана. Административный центр Хачмазского района. Расположен на реке Кудиалчай. Железнодорожная станция в 163 км к северо-западу от Баку на линии Гудермес — Баку.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-ru"},"en":{"text":"Khachmaz (Azerbaijani: Xaçmaz, Lezgian: Хъачмаз) is a town in the Khachmaz District of Azerbaijan.","truncated":false,"source":"wp-en"}},"images":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Xacmaz02252.jpg/960px-Xacmaz02252.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","small":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/ce/Xacmaz02252.jpg/960px-Xacmaz02252.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","width":800,"height":533,"page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xacmaz02252.jpg","title":"Xacmaz02252.jpg","artist":"Gulustan","credit":"Own work","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","source":"img-1"}],"sources":[{"id":"wd","kind":"wikidata","title":"Wikidata Q1018160: Xaçmaz","publisher":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1018160","licence":"CC0 1.0","retrieved":"2026-11-26"},{"id":"wp-az","kind":"wikiped